{"ticker":"L","updated":"2026-11-14T01:10:43Z","profile":{"longName":"Loews Corporation","shortName":"Loews Corporation","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Insurance - Property & Casualty","country":"United States","website":"https://www.loews.com","fullTimeEmployees":13100,"marketCap":22629003264,"trailingPE":15.477179,"forwardPE":38.586205,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.204824,"pegRatio":1.32,"targetMeanPrice":null,"targetHighPrice":null,"targetLowPrice":null,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":null,"recommendationKey":"none","revenueGrowth":0.019,"earningsGrowth":-0.384,"grossMargins":0.35064998,"operatingMargins":0.12443,"profitMargins":0.07928,"totalRevenue":18781999104,"beta":0.486,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":121.01,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":101.08,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.22},"summary":"Loews Corporation, through its subsidiaries, provides commercial property and casualty insurance in the United States and internationally. The company offers specialty insurance products, such as management and professional liability and other coverage products; surety and fidelity bonds; professional liability coverages and risk management services to various professional firms, including architects, real estate agents, and accounting and law firms; standard and excess property, marine and boiler, machinery coverages, workers' compensation, general and product liability, commercial auto, umbrella, excess and surplus coverages, specialized loss-sensitive insurance programs, total risk management services relating to claim and information services; directors and officers, errors and omissions, employment practices, fiduciary, fidelity, and cyber coverages, as well as for small and mid-size firms, public and privately held firms, and not-for-profit organizations; and insurance products to serve the health care industry, including professional and general liability, as well as associated casualty coverage to aging services, allied medical facilities, dentists, physicians, nurses, and other medical practitioners. It also provides warranty and alternative risk, and run-off long-term care insurance products; ethane supply and transportation services for petrochemical customers, as we","summary_zh":"Loews Corporation 透過其子公司在美國和國際上提供商業財產和傷亡保險。該公司提供專業保險產品，例如管理和職業責任以及其他保險產品；擔保和忠誠債券；為各種專業公司（包括建築師、房地產經紀人、會計和律師事務所）提供專業責任保險和風險管理服務；標準和超額財產保險、船舶和鍋爐保險、機械保險、工人賠償、一般和產品責任、商用汽車、雨傘、超額和盈餘保險、專門的損失保險計劃、與索賠和資訊服務有關的全面風險管理服務；董事和管理人員、錯誤和遺漏、僱用實踐、信託、忠誠和網路覆蓋，以及中小型公司、上市和私營公司以及非營利組織；服務於醫療保健行業的保險產品，包括專業責任和一般責任，以及與老齡服務、聯合醫療機構、牙醫、醫生、護士和其他醫療保險從業人員相關的傷亡。它還提供保固和替代風險以及徑流長期護理保險產品；為石化客戶提供乙烷供應和運輸服務，因為我們","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"保險 - 財產與意外傷害","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":97.64,"h":97.84,"l":96.79,"c":96.92,"v":635500},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":96.94,"h":97.1,"l":95.71,"c":95.89,"v":829400},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":96.12,"h":97.23,"l":96.12,"c":96.79,"v":798900},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":96.28,"h":97.49,"l":95.95,"c":97.04,"v":971300},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":97.38,"h":97.38,"l":96.51,"c":96.69,"v":2314100},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":96.35,"h":97.44,"l":96.17,"c":97.24,"v":911900},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":97.06,"h":98.37,"l":97.0,"c":98.0,"v":1110900},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":97.82,"h":99.38,"l":97.82,"c":99.26,"v":789400},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":99.32,"h":100.05,"l":98.76,"c":99.02,"v":865300},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":99.65,"h":100.57,"l":99.65,"c":100.3,"v":702500},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":100.36,"h":100.53,"l":99.08,"c":99.67,"v":760000},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":99.71,"h":100.7,"l":99.62,"c":100.39,"v":671700},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":99.91,"h":100.48,"l":99.69,"c":100.15,"v":719900},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":99.47,"h":101.79,"l":99.47,"c":101.67,"v":867100},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":101.24,"h":102.41,"l":101.24,"c":101.68,"v":899500},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":101.67,"h":102.84,"l":101.67,"c":102.37,"v":566100},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":102.37,"h":103.19,"l":101.82,"c":102.99,"v":945300},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":103.2,"h":103.47,"l":102.55,"c":103.05,"v":415000},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":103.23,"h